> GA.KIN.AG sesan isni tehhun
This line could be interpreted in multiple ways:
    1: Nu arkandan šešan U₃ arkandan GA.KIN.AG išni tēḫḫun.
    2: Nu arkandan šešan išni U₃ ana arkandi GA.KIN.AG tēḫḫun.
It seems the intended interpretation is number...

